    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "models/gemini-3-flash-preview"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI customer support classifier.\n\nAnalyze the customer's message and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nClassify the customer into exactly one intent:\n- ORDER_STATUS\n- REFUND\n- SHIPPING\n- GENERAL\n\nClassify sentiment into exactly one:\n- ANGRY\n- FRUSTRATED\n- POSITIVE\n- NEUTRAL\n\nAlso extract the order ID if one is present.\n\nRules:\n1. Never invent an order ID.\n2. If no order ID is present, return null.\n3. Return only the JSON object.\n4. Do not include markdown or explanations.\n\nOutput format:\n\n{\n  \"intent\": \"ORDER_STATUS\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"NEUTRAL\",\n  \"order_id\": null\n}\n\nCustomer message:\n{{ $json.chatInput }}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {
          "codeExecution": true
        },
        "options": {}
      },
